{"id": "EUVD-2021-34896", "enisaUuid": "d506def7-6246-313f-89ca-d5d1efb7b30d", "description": "Weaver E-cology 8.0 contains a path traversal vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to read arbitrary files through the fpath parameter of the /weaver/ln.FileDownload endpoint. Attackers can send crafted GET requests with directory traversal sequences in fpath to retrieve sensitive files such as WEB-INF/web.xml from the server. Exploitation evidence was first observed by the Shadowserver Foundation on 2023-10-18.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:29", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/main/docs/wiki/oa/%E6%B3%9B%E5%BE%AEOA/%E6%B3%9B%E5%BE%AEOA%20E-Weaver%20ln.FileDownload%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md", "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/weaver/ecology/ecology-filedownload-directory-traversal.yaml", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/weaver-e-cology-8.0-unauthenticated-path-traversal-via-ln-filedownload"], "aliases": ["CVE-2021-48013", "GHSA-ggh3-mmrr-r9c4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8c4264fa-267a-325b-ab6c-bc0361fd6b81", "product": {"name": "e-cology", "vendor": {"name": "Weaver Network Co., Ltd."}}, "product_version": "8.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "08a749e8-f9db-3820-bfbf-affe7c117554", "vendor": {"name": "Weaver Network Co., Ltd."}}], "isExploited": false}